{"id":"n1-180","title":"～がゆえに (～ga yue ni)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the reason or cause; 'because', 'due to', 'as a result of'.","longExplanation":"The ～がゆえに grammar point is used to express a reason or cause, often in more formal writing or speech. It roughly corresponds to 'because (of)', 'due to', or 'as a result of' in English.","formation":"Noun / Verb / Adjective + がゆえに","examples":[{"jp":"愛情がゆえに、彼は彼女を許した。","romaji":"Aijou ga yue ni, kare wa kanojo o yurushita.","en":"Because of love, he forgave her.","words":[{"surface":"愛情","vocabId":"1150860","reading":"あいじょう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゆえに","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"許し","vocabId":"1232860","reading":"ゆるし","baseForm":"許す"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2]},{"jp":"突然の雨がゆえに、試合は延期された。","romaji":"Totsuzen no ame ga yue ni, shiai wa enki sareta.","en":"Due to the sudden rain, the match was postponed.","words":[{"surface":"突然","vocabId":"1457040","reading":"とつぜん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゆえに","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試合","vocabId":"1312420","reading":"しあい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"延期","vocabId":"1176430","reading":"えんき"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"彼の努力がゆえに、彼は成功を収めた。","romaji":"Kare no doryoku ga yue ni, kare wa seikou o osameta.","en":"Because of his efforts, he achieved success.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"努力","vocabId":"1445130","reading":"どりょく"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゆえに","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"収め","vocabId":"1589090","reading":"おさめる","baseForm":"収める"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"彼の死がゆえに、彼の家族は深い悲しみに包まれた。","romaji":"Kare no shi ga yue ni, kare no kazoku wa fukai kanashimi ni tsutsumareta.","en":"Due to his death, his family was enveloped in deep sorrow.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"死","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゆえに","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"家族","vocabId":"1192150","reading":"かぞく"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"深い","vocabId":"1362640","reading":"ふかい"},{"surface":"悲しみ","vocabId":"1590550","reading":"かなしみ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"包ま","vocabId":"1584060","reading":"つつむ","baseForm":"包む"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary/academic; emphasizes logical cause-and-effect. Rare in speech.","family":{"id":"causality","name":"Causality (Because / Since / Due to)","relatedPoints":["n5-073","n4-078","n5-088","n4-124","n2-019","n3-127","n5-074","n4-081","n2-060","n2-153","n4-110","n3-049","n3-072","n1-184","n1-181","n3-004"]}}